For high availability, we will deploy the solution on a cloud provider with a proven track record, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, utilizing their EU regions and ensuring auto-scaling capabilities to handle varying workloads. Our experience with containerization using Docker and Kubernetes will enable efficient management of resources.

